  "body": "https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#idl-DOMException-error-names defines two tables with the error names. We should turn that back into a single table. With the current setup it's a) not clear that legacy error names are part of the setup since they are in their own table and b) the relative order is lost which is important when defining properties on an object and enumerating them later.\r\n\r\nSpotted while working on https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/4581.",
